OL,3,GNEWSALetby prosecutors knew expert     
OL,4,Awitness was under investigation        
OL,6,FPolice and prosecutors knew an expert  
OL,7,Fwitness against Lucy Letby was under   
OL,8,Finvestigation over his fitness to      
OL,9,Fpractise when he gave evidence at her  
OL,10,Ftrial.                                 
OL,12,FProf Peter Hindmarsh testified that he 
OL,13,Fbelieved that two babies Letby was     
OL,14,Faccused of attempting to murder had    
OL,15,Fbeen poisoned with insulin.            
OL,17,FBefore the first of his two court      
OL,18,Fappearances, however, Hindmarsh had    
OL,19,Fbeen referred to the General Medical   
OL,20,FCouncil (GMC).                         
